    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... i've tried talking and it just makes it worse. when i tell them i'm struggling, i can see the stress on their faces. i can see how much energy they have to spend just to keep me afloat. it's like i'm just a constant drain on their lives. wouldn't it be easier for them if i just wasn't a factor anymore? if they didn't have to worry about me?",
